    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποψεκάζω</span></b> , metaph., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tipple a little,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.30
			</span></i>, in phrase <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυκνὸν ὑ.,</span>
			prob. cited from <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.26
			</span></i>, where codd. have <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιψακ-</span>
			or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιψεκ-; ὑπεψεκάζομεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποψακ-</span> is found in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.20
			</span></i> and as v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				6.30
			</span></i>.</div>
